OL,3,GNEWSA'I wish we were being told more
OL,4,Aafter Birmingham fire'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who lost her childhood home
OL,7,Fduring devastating fires in the West
OL,8,FMidlands last week has criticised a
OL,9,Flocal council for what she called a
OL,10,Flack of communication with her father
OL,11,Fwho escaped the premises unharmed.
OL,13,FCarol Squires grew up in the council
OL,14,Fproperty on Gorleston Road in Warstock,
OL,15,FBirmingham, and her 70-year-old father
OL,16,FWilliam Lloyd was living there when the
OL,17,Fblaze broke out.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
