OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-% -$%%-%-$%%%%-!"$--%& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'I wish we were being told more
OL,4,Aafter Birmingham fire'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fire, which started on Thursday,
OL,7,Fdestroyed six homes in total and
OL,8,Faffected dozens of gardens. But while
OL,9,FSquires's dad was safe, and Birmingham
OL,10,FCity Council had since found him
OL,11,Fsomwhere else to live, she said there
OL,12,Fneeded to be greater detail about what
OL,13,Fwould happen to him.
OL,15,FA neighbour has shared similar
OL,16,Ffrustration over communication with the
OL,17,Fauthority which said its officers had
OL,18,Fbeen helping those who were affected
OL,19,Fand in temporary accommodation.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
